  "solution": "**Given:**\n\n x⁴ + (1)/(x⁴) = 322 \n\n**Formula used:**\n\n x⁴ + (1)/(x⁴) = (x² + (1)/(x²))² - 2 \n\n x³ - (1)/(x³) = (x - (1)/(x)) times ( x² + (1)/(x²) + 1 ) \n\n**Calculations:**\n\n 322 = (x² + (1)/(x²))² - 2 \n\n⇒ (x² + (1)/(x²))² = 324 \n\n⇒ x² + (1)/(x²) = sqrt{324} = 18 \n\nLet y = x - (1)/(x) \n\nThen, y² = x² - 2 + (1)/(x²) \n\n⇒ y² = 18 - 2 \n\n⇒ y² = 16 \n\n⇒ y = 4 \n\n x³ - (1)/(x³) = y times ( x² + (1)/(x²) + 1 ) \n\n⇒ x³ - (1)/(x³) = 4 times (18 + 1) \n\n⇒ x³ - (1)/(x³) = 4 times 19 = 76 \n\n**∴ The value of x³ - (1)/(x³) is 76.**",
